{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/inverted.png?t=1747430188\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tarot card themed rogue-lite action game testing your reflex.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock playable Major Arcana with unique skills and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic rogue-lite gameplay by combining different Minor Arcana.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Extra</i> rogue-lite gameplay with stage adjustments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging levels and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Appreciate the beautiful original Rider-Waite public domain artwork.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your mouse and control your fate to survive the Star, Moon, Sun and Judgement and flip the World back to normal!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Each Major Arcana has their unique active and passive skills!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/high_priestess_desc.png?t=1747430188\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Utilize the Minor Arcana each with their unique readings to help you survive!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/minor_arcana_select.png?t=1747430188\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Carefully select the Major Arcana that changes the stage difficulty!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/major_arcana_select.png?t=1747430188\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defeat the different stages and explore blocks with unique effects!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/blocks.png?t=1747430188\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/pentacle.png?t=1747430188\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/sword.png?t=1747430188\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/cups.png?t=1747430188\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/wand.png?t=1747430188\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"MAGICIAN UNLOCKED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665270/3be9a698589b436ca3200e342b2cd30691e6212b.jpg"},{"name":"HIGH PRIESTESS UNLOCKED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665270/7ce10bd3a758ad8c1cde90340a34374b3a1dcfb5.jpg"},{"name":"EMPRESS UNLOCKED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665270/7f042f40ed91ecf3d26482f391cfe41001d397d4.jpg"},{"name":"EMPEROR UNLOCKED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665270/5a6a001325ea7b79dddb9caddee29cefa2690764.jpg"},{"name":"HIEROPHANT UNLOCKED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665270/d06b66a078908b53ce3fc3870f328bb40ee142d7.jpg"},{"name":"LOVERS UNLOCKED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665270/bd47c618a6974ac3a174deb15a8b1ec238733b63.jpg"},{"name":"CHARIOT UNLOCKED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665270/9e24adfe442227fbdfafe700f733bf3de494b418.jpg"},{"name":"STRENGTH UNLOCKED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3665270/fdec7339fbcfd39b0fc19e89